{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/TLF_About_Banner.gif?t=1745525756\" />Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After being sent into The Facility's 50 chambers, you are tasked to complete all experiments involving lava for freedom. But along the way, you must survive everything that will be thrown at you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Each Death Is One Step Closer To Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every time you die, you will be able to read reports by the staff watching on how you died and what you died to, you will also learn how to avoid the death cause next time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/TLF_Features_Banner_1.gif?t=1745525756\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Random Room Generation</strong>:\u00a0Every run will be different from the others. Whether its when threats spawn, or the chamber you must complete.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chapter-Based Story</strong>: The story is separated between <u><i><strong>3 Chapters</strong></i></u>. The first chapter is free and the rest will be Paid DLC.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Advanced Movement</strong>: There are many movement features to serve your needs, such as <i>Ziplines</i>, <i>Ladders</i>, <i>Wall Jumping</i>, and <i>Climbing</i><strong>.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Community Paintings</strong>: Submit your own art in our discord server and have it featured in the game!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/TLF_Inspirations_Banner_1.gif?t=1745525756\" />This game wouldn't have been made if it wasn't for these amazing games inspiring me</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> DOORS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Portal 1 &amp; 2</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Karlson</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681650?t=1745525756","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681650?t=1745525756","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/4fd7e4277f44863a325378260b36310eb5018f1d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745525756","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/4fd7e4277f44863a325378260b36310eb5018f1d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745525756","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/TLF_About_Banner.gif?t=1745525756\" />Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After being sent into The Facility's 50 chambers, you are tasked to complete all experiments involving lava for freedom. But along the way, you must survive everything that will be thrown at you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Each Death Is One Step Closer To Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every time you die, you will be able to read reports by the staff watching on how you died and what you died to, you will also learn how to avoid the death cause next time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/TLF_Features_Banner_1.gif?t=1745525756\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Random Room Generation</strong>:\u00a0Every run will be different from th